
---

## `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Airflow
airflow_home/
airflow/logs/
airflow/logs/**
airflow/*.db
airflow/airflow.cfg
airflow/webserver_config.py

# PySpark / Spark temp
spark-warehouse/
metastore_db/
derby.log

# Checkpoints / runtime temp
checkpoints/
tmp/
*.log
*.out
*.err

# Jupyter / notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# VSCode
.vscode/
.history/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build / cache
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.cache/

# Docker
docker-compose.override.yml

# Local data exports or accidental generated files
*.csv~
*.bak
*.tmp

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
*.so

# Optional: uncomment if you do NOT want to push raw sample data
# data/cassandra/*.csv
# data/mysql/*.csv